%% FMEA corrections, 2 October 2026. Historical master diagram is not the hosted contract.
flowchart TD
  U(["USER: choose attachment or reopen plan"]):::term --> F["FUNCTION · file selection generation<br/>in: selected file + owner/thread<br/>out: only the current attachment"]:::fn
  U --> A["FUNCTION · authenticated thread GET<br/>in: owned thread ID<br/>out: saved messages"]:::fn
  A --> T[("DATA · owned Tracker rows<br/>authoritative approval state")]:::data
  T --> H["FUNCTION · hydrate approval DTO<br/>out: Tracker link or explicit Approve button<br/>no historical message rewrite"]:::fn
  P["AGENT · bounded provider request<br/>out: text + terminal status + usage"]:::agent --> S["FUNCTION · settle known usage"]:::fn
  S --> D{"Explicit successful completion?"}:::dec
  D -->|Yes| R["FUNCTION · canonical brand scoring<br/>out: persisted answer/report"]:::fn
  D -->|No| E(["Safe error; no automatic retry<br/>bounded diagnostic metadata only"]):::term
  classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0b2a5b;
  classDef fn fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
  classDef dec fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef data fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef term fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827;
